# Sage of the Fang ({2}{G}, 2/2): "Renew -- {3}{G}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Put a +1/+1 counter on target
# creature, then double the number of +1/+1 counters on that creature. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot2 Bolts both Sages. On
# turn 5, with an Ornithopter on the stack, renew is refused (sorcery timing) with the mana to pay; once it resolves it is
# refused on Mox Emerald (not a creature). A creature with no counters then ends with two (0+1, doubled); on turn 7 Bot2's
# Ornithopter, which the second Sage's enters trigger gave one, ends with four (1+1, doubled).

